  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans:\r\n\r\nSite Location Plan 2086 _GL _001, 2086_GL _002, 2086_GL _012, 2086_GA_001, 2086_GA_011, 2086_GA_012, 2086_GE_001, 2086_GE_002, 2086_GS_001, Design and Access Statement, Outline Heritage Statement \r\n\r\nReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interest of proper planning.\r\n",
    "Condition : 2 - The building hereby permitted is for a temporary period only and shall be \r\nremoved on or before 2 June 2030.    \r\n  \r\nReason: The type of structure is not such as the Council is prepared to \r\napprove, other than for a limited period, in view of its appearance. The \r\npermanent retention of the structure would be contrary to the requirements of \r\npolicies D1 and D2 of the Camden Local Plan 2017. "
